# TypeScript

Generic helpers go in `@repo/utils`. Note rules go in `@repo/domain`. Generated GraphQL types stay generated.

Use curly braces for every `if`, `for`, and `while` body.

Use axios for HTTP. Do not use `fetch` in app code. The GraphQL and webhook servers may use the runtime's `Bun.serve`.

Tests sit next to the function, import from `bun:test`, and use `describe(fn.name)`. Name the values `expected` and `result`. `test:unit` is `bun test src`. Playwright files are `*.e2e.ts` so `bun test` does not load them.

TypeScript uses `moduleResolution: bundler`. Do not add `.ts` suffixes to imports.
